IS-A关系需要遵守里氏替换原则:
If for each object o1 of type S there is an object o2 of type T such that for all programs P defined in terms of T, the behavior of P is unchanged when
o1 is substituted for o2, then S is a subtype of T. 
至于S和T的关系，通常是public 继承关系。但也可以是unrelated classes that support the same interface and can therefore be used interchangeably in templated code that uses that common interface. 
Is-Implemented-In-Terms-Of(IIITO) 通常有两种实现方式
// Example 23-1(a): "T IIITO U" using Has-A
//
class T
{
// ...
private:
